  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "homepage-v1",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -46,
      "w": 1400,
      "text": "homepage-v1 — the founder-approved homepage and identity, 2026-09-08. Not a wireframe: this is the finished direction every other artboard is drawn in. Round 2 changed copy and section order only."
    },
    {
      "id": "system",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6014,
      "w": 1400,
      "text": "system — the shipped design system: every primitive at every state, the type ramp and script coverage, the palette and its contrast manifest. Kept in step with src/modules/ui in both directions."
    },
    {
      "id": "flows",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 12334,
      "w": 1400,
      "text": "flows — the buyer journey home → track, the florist journey landing → first order, and the first-visit surfaces. Round 2: destination and date are settled before the basket, and the total cannot move after the product page."
    },
    {
      "id": "wireframes",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 15400,
      "w": 1400,
      "text": "wireframes — one desktop (1440) and one mobile (390) artboard per Phase 0 page type, in buyer-journey order. Round 2 (TASK-059, 2026-09-09): every page reworked against docs/design/benchmarks/ — the fee printed on every date chip, cutoffs in the recipient's time zone, a priced product row before any editorial section, the practical country block, the published amendment window, no-login tracking with actionable problem options, and first-person copy throughout. benchmarks/README.md records what each page type took and dropped, and the fourteen questions left for the founder."
    },
